		"&eSlowpoke &f(手持 King's Rock) → &bSlowking"
		"&eHaunter &f→ &bGengar"
		"&e大舌舔 &f(手持金属涂层) → &b钢甲暴"
		"&e镰刀镰 &f(手持护盾) → &b超镰刀镰"
		"&eSeadra &f(持有 Dragon Scale) → &bKingdra"
		"&e巨钳切裂虫 &f(手持金属涂层) → &b钳螳螂"
		"&eElectabuzz &f(手持 Electirizer) → &bElectivire"
		"&eMagmar &f(手持 Magmarizer) → &bMagmortar"
		"&e多边兽 &f(手持升级) → &b多边兽2型"
		"&e多边兽2型 &f(手持可疑的圆盘) → &b多边兽Z型"
		"&e费巴斯 &f(手持棱镜鳞) → &b美纳斯"
		"&eDusclops &f(手持 Reaper Cloth) → &bDusknoir"
		"&eClamperl &f(holding Deep Sea Tooth) → &bHuntail"
		"&eClamperl &f(持有深海鳞片) → &bGorebyss"
		"&eBoldore &f→ &bGigalith"
